#: src/scenes/blog.rb:2572
msgctxt "Blog"
msgid ""
"Configure your domain to point to the Elten Blogging server using the details "
"below. If you have any problems, ask for help on the forum.\n"
"\n"
"Where possible, we recommend using a CNAME record because it does not need to "
"be updated if the IP address of the server hosting your blog changes, for exam"
"ple during an Elten Blogging server migration. Point the CNAME record to %{hos"
"t}.\n"
"\n"
"Many domain registrars do not support CNAME records for apex domains. In that "
"case, use an A record and point it to the following IP address:\n"
"%{ip}\n"
"\n"
"Pointing a domain is not the same as configuring an alias or an HTTP 301/3xx r"
"edirect; aliases and HTTP redirects will not work.\n"
"\n"
"Detailed instructions are available from your domain provider, for example at:"
"\n"
"https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/115001994890-Getting-Familia"
"r-with-DNS\n"
"\n"
"Once you have finished, continue."
msgstr ""

