#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:264
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"The Feed tab will not be shown in your main window, so you may also prefer not"
" to be notified about new feed entries. Ticking the option below keeps the fee"
"d quiet: you can still open it and follow people whenever you wish, but new en"
"tries will no longer announce themselves. Leave it unticked to keep receiving "
"feed notifications as usual."
msgstr ""

