msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Elten could not load your current main-language setting."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:546
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Your account does not have a main language set."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:548
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Your current main language is %{language}."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:551
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Choose a language only if you want to replace the setting that could not be re"
"ad. Otherwise, select Do not change and review it later in your account settin"
"gs."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:553
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Your main language tells Elten which language community you belong to: it is u"
"sed to recommend forum groups, deliver language-specific notifications and mat"
"ch you with content you can read. It does not change the language of the Elten"
" interface."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:555
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"It matches the language of the interface, which is usually exactly right. Chan"
"ge it only if you prefer community content in another language."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:557
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"The Elten interface is currently set to %{language}. Using different languages"
" for the two is perfectly fine; this page simply asks you to confirm that the "
"difference is intentional."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:568
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Main language"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:582 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:592
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Other languages"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:585
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten could not load your other language settings. Any languages selected here"
" will replace the unread setting. Leave every item unticked to make no change "
"and review it later in your account settings."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:587
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"If you are comfortable in languages besides your main one, you can list them h"
"ere, and Elten will include community content in those languages as well. This"
" is entirely optional; leave every item unticked to make no change."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:589
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"The other languages currently stored on your account are selected below. Elten"
" uses this list when including language-specific community content. Leave the "
"selection as it is to make no change."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:596
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Additional languages"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:613 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:622
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Public name"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:616
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten could not load the public name currently stored on your profile. Enter a"
" name only if you want to replace it. Leave the field empty to make no change "
"and review your profile later."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:618
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Alongside your username, your profile can display a public name. Many people u"
"se their real name, but any name the community knows you by will do. It is opt"
"ional and does not change the name you sign in with. Leave the field empty if "
"you would rather not display one."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:620
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"The name below is displayed publicly on your profile alongside your username. "
"Edit it if it is out of date, clear it to remove it, or leave it as it is."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:623
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Full name or preferred public name"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:629 src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:638
#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:644
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Gender"
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:633
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Gender is an optional profile field. Besides appearing on your profile, it let"
"s Elten choose the correct grammatical forms when referring to you in language"
"s that need them. Your current setting is %{gender}. Choose the appropriate va"
"lue, or Do not specify if you would rather not share it."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:635
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid ""
"Elten could not load your current gender setting. Choose Female or Male only i"
"f you want to set it now. Leave Do not specify selected to make no change and "
"review your profile later."
msgstr ""

#: src/scenes/welcome_wizard.rb:641
msgctxt "WelcomeWizard"
msgid "Do not specify"
msgstr ""

